-- Vault · Strength and Conditioning, rewritten in the house voice (docs/VAULT_VOICE.md).
-- Eight lessons in reading order, every piece with the loop, a quiz, risks and verified references.
-- Retired: the engine builder (a compression of lessons 3 and 4). Deload absorbs active recovery (was on Recovery).
-- Numbers follow the registry: Zone 2 is 2–4 sessions of 45–60 min at conversational pace; the 4×4 is 4 × 4 min
-- at 90–95% of maximum heart rate with 3 min easy, once a week after 4–6 weeks of base; deload every 4–6 weeks
-- with volume cut by 40–50%. Helgerud's gain is 7.2%, not 10%.
